  {
   "id": "machine-gun-fury-211331@patch-2026-02-18",
   "gameId": "machine-gun-fury-211331",
   "displayName": "Machine Gun Fury — Major Patch, New Publisher, Languages & Console Launch!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-18T17:30:08.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When tyranny takes control… we level up. So, we’re excited to share some big news with all Machine Gun Fury players!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎉 New Publisher & Console Launch Announcement & New Prices",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’re excited to share that Machine Gun Fury has officially found a new publishing partner! ESDigital Games will now publish Machine Gun Fury worldwide and bring the game to new platforms.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Thanks to this new collaboration, the game is coming to",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "PlayStation 4 & PlayStation 5",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Xbox Series X|S & Xbox One",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Nintendo Switch",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "In addition, we’ve reduced the game’s price to make it even more accessible to players worldwide. We’re incredibly happy about this new chapter and can’t wait to bring the fury to even more players around the world.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🔧 Major PC Patch — Available Now!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]A new update is live for all PC players, and it’s a big one. First of all, Machine Gun Fury is now available in 11 new languages:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "French",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Italian",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "German",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spanish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Russian",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Portuguese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Polish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Japanese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Korean",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Simplified Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Traditional Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]More soldiers. More frontlines. Worldwide.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🎮 UI & Visual Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]We’ve updated several core interface elements to improve clarity and gameplay flow:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New font implemented",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "XP bar redesigned",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lives counter redesigned",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ammo counter redesigned",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🛠 Bug Fixes & Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Numerous bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay polish and minor stability improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "General performance tweaks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "But that’s not all.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Machine Gun Fury will also be showcased at GDC 2026, where attendees will have the chance to go hands-on with the game and experience the chaos firsthand.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]And it won’t be alone — you’ll also be able to play:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sky of Tides",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "AWAKEN – Astral Blade",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Remedium",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Island of Winds",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
